更に総理大臣（野田佳彦）の誕生か？」\nその他の台詞等はおまかせします。", "nc": 168, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@amane_ichijo/works/16", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3660070, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9f6ffc75/uploads/origins/7ba43a87-341c-46ed-884d-06505fcb20c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de38fe48a8c2b53578b1e521f2f6ddf3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9f6ffc75/uploads/origins/7ba43a87-341c-46ed-884d-06505fcb20c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de38fe48a8c2b53578b1e521f2f6ddf3, https://si.imgix.net/9f6ffc75/uploads/origins/7ba43a87-341c-46ed-884d-06505fcb20c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a458902c0ebe803d9c50c67bf1260122 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9f6ffc75/uploads/origins/7ba43a87-341c-46ed-884d-06505fcb20c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6084bf7aea7a96ce272280ba473b8341 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9f6ffc75/uploads/origins/7ba43a87-341c-46ed-884d-06505fcb20c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a1f767c4af2c849a2e01214e4600abc5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9f6ffc75/uploads/origins/7ba43a87-341c-46ed-884d-06505fcb20c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a1f767c4af2c849a2e01214e4600abc5, https://si.imgix.net/9f6ffc75/uploads/origins/7ba43a87-341c-46ed-884d-06505fcb20c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1834c46a76b6e897ca08e1e1f287cfae 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9f6ffc75/uploads/origins/7ba43a87-341c-46ed-884d-06505fcb20c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=20d2ecb0846bc077f4f17fe0a2ba6ce0 3x"}, "body": "初リクエストお願いします！\n\n古明地こいしが捕まえた男にお仕置きと称して、首4の字をかけながら素足履きの激臭ブーツで顔を覆っているイラストをお願いします！\nこいしの足は汗だくで、ネバッとした汗が糸を引いている。(細かくてすみません)\n\n男はあまりの臭いで嗚咽をし吐きそうになっている状態。\n\n台詞は、何日も素足で履きっぱなしだったブーツの臭いはどうかと質問している点、吐いたり気絶したらもっと臭い思いをさせると脅している点などを挿れていただけると嬉しいです。\n\nよろしくお願いします！", "nc": 33, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@amane_ichijo/works/15", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ddfe9676/uploads/origins/21fb363c-17fd-42fa-b315-a634dc73126e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=43f7b0247051aaf58cd5a5f92cd4b991", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ddfe9676/uploads/origins/21fb363c-17fd-42fa-b315-a634dc73126e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=43f7b0247051aaf58cd5a5f92cd4b991, https://si.imgix.net/ddfe9676/uploads/origins/21fb363c-17fd-42fa-b315-a634dc73126e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4225dd868843b0ac39cc0dacdbd19114 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ddfe9676/uploads/origins/21fb363c-17fd-42fa-b315-a634dc73126e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9373799694922469262786250eddb30c 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3660070, "client_id": 3385141, "nc": 161}, {"path": "/@amane_ichijo/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3660070, "client_id": 187294, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/38549fa5/uploads